      "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/columncontrol/cols",
      "col1": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "sling:resourceType": "wcm/foundation/components/parsys",
        "sectionseparator": {
          "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
          "jcr:createdBy": "user-98fdffe29c@example.invalid",
          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-98fdffe29c@example.invalid",
          "jcr:created": "Thu Jul 21 2022 18:02:17 GMT+0000",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Thu Jul 21 2022 18:02:17 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/sectionseparator"
        },
        "text_copy": {
          "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
          "jcr:createdBy": "user-7a617b9e44@example.invalid",
          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-9846ac1203@example.invalid",
          "jcr:created": "Wed May 24 2023 13:37:44 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<h2><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\"><span style=\"color: #1c5687;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Purpose-built for patient care</span></span></span></span></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><b>Communicate intuitively:</b> Make, receive, transfer and forward calls using a natural, voice-driven experience. Say, “OK Vocera” to wake up the device and start communicating.<br>\n <br>\n </span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><b>Improve staff safety:</b> Communicate safely, even under restrictive personal protective equipment (PPE), to help reduce the spread of infection. In an emergency, activate the dedicated panic button to discreetly open a communication channel to the response team.<br>\n <br>\n </span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><b>Help reduce interruption fatigue and stay focused on critical patient care:</b> Set your device to do-not-disturb mode and accept or decline notifications. Avoid communication dead ends with call escalation to the next available person or team.&nbsp;<br>\n <br>\n </span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><b>Easily reach the right person or team:</b> Reach contacts by saying their name, role, group or extension. Page a user or group. Call people inside or outside your health system.<br>\n <br>\n </span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><b>Triage events quickly:</b> Determine the urgency of events via notifications with detailed context on the Smartbadge.<br>\n <br>\n </span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><b>Leverage smartphone functionality: </b>Get smartphone usability and hands-free mobility with the Smartbadge’s ample touchscreen.</span></span></li>\n</ul>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Wed Jul 05 2023 14:43:13 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        }
      }
    },
