          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-7a617b9e44@example.invalid",
          "jcr:created": "Wed May 24 2023 20:35:38 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<p><span style=\"font-size: 19.5px;\"><b><span style=\"color: #1c5687;\"><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Simple functionality</span></span></span></span></b></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">Combine smartphone usability and hands-free mobility</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">Ample touchscreen to find contacts quickly, with a near-real time view of patients and staff across multiple sites</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">Read and type text messages, and receive notifications with context about the patient, event and care team</span></span></li>\n</ul>\n",
